{"4084220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bunker 1945 - Capture the Gray Wolf", "steam_appid": 4084220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s April 30th 1945, 14:00 hours in central Berlin. Battle for the Reichstag is raging as the Red Army troops close in on the remaining few buildings in central Berlin. A special unit of the Red Army is designated by marshal Zhukov to inspect the area of the New Reich Chancellery, believed to be the enemy’s last command post. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of 8 soldiers that departed from the Reichstag battlefield to go inspect the Chancellery, only one makes it through. Disoriented and terrified by constant fire, he stumbles upon the Reich’s Chancellery garden. In desperation to hide from artillery fire, the soldier makes a dash for a square concrete structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/6c6dd27a07824e60618bd44f95725423.poster.avif?t=1776672316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/6c6dd27a07824e60618bd44f95725423.webm?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/6c6dd27a07824e60618bd44f95725423.mp4?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon entering, he realizes this is the Führerbunker - an underground stronghold where the German leader is preparing for his end. He decides to infiltrate the bunker and capture the notorious dictator - before he takes his own life and escapes the consequences of his atrocious actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/98fc2893e7d1f71a1dd41d16c91ccc91.poster.avif?t=1776672316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/98fc2893e7d1f71a1dd41d16c91ccc91.webm?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/98fc2893e7d1f71a1dd41d16c91ccc91.mp4?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunker 1945 is a first-person puzzle adventure set in a historically inspired World War II bunker. Players explore and interact with their surroundings, solve intricate puzzles, engage in tense conversations with staff, and use stealth to avoid enemy patrols - all to capture the world's most evil man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/3bac032dae29eebffa47d06518159989.poster.avif?t=1776672316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/3bac032dae29eebffa47d06518159989.webm?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/3bac032dae29eebffa47d06518159989.mp4?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/02e62f07e0e532b2251ff555b202a22a.poster.avif?t=1776672316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/02e62f07e0e532b2251ff555b202a22a.webm?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/02e62f07e0e532b2251ff555b202a22a.mp4?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Historical Accuracy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters, locations and events are based on real historical facts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/baf7a252d354af8049aef4cd6806ad77.avif?t=1776672316\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layouts, props, and audio ambience inspired by plans, documents, and testimony.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/4d0135b713b85aaf1a0697178a07746b.poster.avif?t=1776672316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/4d0135b713b85aaf1a0697178a07746b.webm?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/4d0135b713b85aaf1a0697178a07746b.mp4?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/3e1f7309d061de57598cb19bc649db43.poster.avif?t=1776672316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/3e1f7309d061de57598cb19bc649db43.webm?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/3e1f7309d061de57598cb19bc649db43.mp4?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s April 30th 1945, 14:00 hours in central Berlin. Battle for the Reichstag is raging as the Red Army troops close in on the remaining few buildings in central Berlin. A special unit of the Red Army is designated by marshal Zhukov to inspect the area of the New Reich Chancellery, believed to be the enemy’s last command post. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of 8 soldiers that departed from the Reichstag battlefield to go inspect the Chancellery, only one makes it through. Disoriented and terrified by constant fire, he stumbles upon the Reich’s Chancellery garden. In desperation to hide from artillery fire, the soldier makes a dash for a square concrete structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/6c6dd27a07824e60618bd44f95725423.poster.avif?t=1776672316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/6c6dd27a07824e60618bd44f95725423.webm?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/6c6dd27a07824e60618bd44f95725423.mp4?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon entering, he realizes this is the Führerbunker - an underground stronghold where the German leader is preparing for his end. He decides to infiltrate the bunker and capture the notorious dictator - before he takes his own life and escapes the consequences of his atrocious actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/98fc2893e7d1f71a1dd41d16c91ccc91.poster.avif?t=1776672316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/98fc2893e7d1f71a1dd41d16c91ccc91.webm?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/98fc2893e7d1f71a1dd41d16c91ccc91.mp4?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunker 1945 is a first-person puzzle adventure set in a historically inspired World War II bunker. Players explore and interact with their surroundings, solve intricate puzzles, engage in tense conversations with staff, and use stealth to avoid enemy patrols - all to capture the world's most evil man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/3bac032dae29eebffa47d06518159989.poster.avif?t=1776672316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/3bac032dae29eebffa47d06518159989.webm?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/3bac032dae29eebffa47d06518159989.mp4?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/02e62f07e0e532b2251ff555b202a22a.poster.avif?t=1776672316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/02e62f07e0e532b2251ff555b202a22a.webm?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/02e62f07e0e532b2251ff555b202a22a.mp4?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Historical Accuracy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters, locations and events are based on real historical facts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/baf7a252d354af8049aef4cd6806ad77.avif?t=1776672316\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layouts, props, and audio ambience inspired by plans, documents, and testimony.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/4d0135b713b85aaf1a0697178a07746b.poster.avif?t=1776672316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/4d0135b713b85aaf1a0697178a07746b.webm?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/4d0135b713b85aaf1a0697178a07746b.mp4?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/3e1f7309d061de57598cb19bc649db43.poster.avif?t=1776672316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/3e1f7309d061de57598cb19bc649db43.webm?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/extras/3e1f7309d061de57598cb19bc649db43.mp4?t=1776672316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "First-person puzzle game where you play as a Soviet soldier in the Battle for Berlin. Infiltrate a secret bunker, collect historical evidence, solve puzzles, and hide from top ranking Nazis. Your goal is to capture Adolf Hitler alive and make him face the consequences of his crimes.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/751e422fc8f0050ed25cf5191990ccf8f10e8ce5/header.jpg?t=1776672316", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/138790d6780c29dbf55d6f3e72fb6d5e92e1d1da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776672316", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084220/138790d6780c29dbf55d6f3e72fb6d5e92e1d1da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776672316", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 10th gen / AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660 6GB / AMD RX 6600<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 3600K / AMD ryzen 5 7600<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</